# An Unfinished Constellation
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
You connected the wrong stars.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
I was making a new constellation.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
What is it called?
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
The Road We Have Not Taken.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Then leave it unfinished. We might find more stars later.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
She leans against you, warm beneath the evening shawl.
